# UXC: unknown 1234x567 falls back to scan mode; the host moves to 1024x768 during the scan, scan finds it, bridge mode again.
chip ux
board beta
file /etc/kvm/hdmi_mode 0
file /kvmapp/kvm/state 0\n
file /kvmapp/kvm/width 1920\n
file /kvmapp/kvm/height 1080\n
vidbg auto
src 1920 1080
call init
at 1100
call mjpeg 1920 1080 80 every 200 until 2000
at 2000
src 1234 567
int fall
at 2100
call mjpeg 1920 1080 80 every 200 until 9000
at 9000
src 1024 768
at 9100
call mjpeg 1024 768 80 every 200 until 40000
at 40000
src 1280 720
int fall
at 40100
call mjpeg 1280 720 80 every 200 until 45000
at 45000
end
